<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center; color: #231F20"><B>OTHER MATTERS</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; color: #231F20">The Board of Directors is not
aware of any other matters to be submitted to the EGM. If any other matters properly come before the EGM, it is the intention of the
persons named in the enclosed form of proxy to vote the shares they represent as the Board of Directors may recommend.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

