<TD STYLE="width: 0%"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.5in; text-align: left">1.</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">The name of the Company
                                            is <B>Kaixin Holdings</B>.</TD>
</TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

