<TD STYLE="width: 0%"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.5in">2.</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">The registered office of the Company shall
                                            be at Harneys Fiduciary (Cayman) Limited, 4th Floor, Harbour Place, 103 South Church Street,
                                            P.O.&nbsp;Box 10240, Grand Cayman KY1-1002, Cayman Islands or at such other place as the
