    <TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify">means Ordinary Shares of a par value of US$<STRIKE>0.00075
    </STRIKE><FONT STYLE="border-bottom-style: double; border-bottom-width: 0.5pt; padding-bottom: 0.5pt"><U>0.012</U></FONT> each in
