    <TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify; width: 62%">a clearing house recognised by the laws of
    the jurisdiction in which the shares of the Company (or depositary receipts therefor) are listed or quoted on a stock exchange or
    interdealer quotation system in such jurisdiction;</TD></TR>
