    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: top; font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: left">&nbsp;</TD><TD STYLE="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: bottom">
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="vertical-align: top; font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: left">&nbsp;</TD><TD STYLE="font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify">(b) <FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">approved in writing by
    all of the Members entitled to vote at a general meeting of the Company in one or more instruments each signed by one or more of
    the Members and the effective date of the resolution so adopted shall be the date on which the instrument, or the last of such instruments
    if more than one, is executed;</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
